    customs_reality_en: "Land-locked Himalayan kingdom. Almost all imports transit through India. Very limited international shipping options — DHL is the main express carrier. Remote location means long delivery times. Customs can be slow due to limited staff and infrastructure. Phuentsholing crossing can be backed up during monsoon season.",
