    import_license_info_en: "Required for firearms, pharmaceuticals, agrochemicals, used vehicles, and certain food products. INEN quality standards (NTE) required for many consumer goods. Import permits from AGROCALIDAD for agricultural products.",
    import_license_info_ru: "Требуется для оружия, фармацевтики, агрохимикатов, подержанных авто и некоторых продуктов. Стандарты качества INEN (NTE) для многих потребительских товаров. Разрешения AGROCALIDAD для сельхозпродуктов.",
    customs_reality_en: "Uses US dollar as currency (no exchange rate risk). $400 de minimis under the 4x4 program (up to 4 packages per year, each under 4kg, under $400). Duties can be high (up to 30%) on clothing and luxury goods. ECUAPASS system is functional but bureaucratic. Courier clearance 2-3 days. Postal mail 2-4 weeks. FODINFA (child development fund) surcharge of 0.5% on CIF. Safeguard tariffs have been imposed periodically on various goods. INEN technical standards can block imports that don't comply.",
