    import_license_info_en: "Required for firearms, alcohol, tobacco, and some agricultural products. Quarantine inspection for all food and plant imports. Each state may have additional requirements.",
    import_license_info_ru: "Требуется для оружия, алкоголя, табака и некоторых сельхозпродуктов. Карантинная инспекция для всех продуктов и растений. Каждый штат может иметь дополнительные требования.",
    customs_reality_en: "EXTREMELY REMOTE — 607 islands spread across the western Pacific. Only accessible by air (United Airlines island hopper) or infrequent cargo ships. Duties are low (0-6%) but logistics costs are enormous. No international courier services to most islands. USPS available to Pohnpei (capital). Cargo ships from Guam serve as main supply. Each state has different regulations. Infrastructure is very basic. Expect 4-8 weeks for deliveries. US dollar currency (no exchange risk). Climate change and rising seas are existential logistics threats.",
