    customs_reality_en: "One of the world's easiest places to import. No corruption, minimal bureaucracy. Most shipments clear same day. Free trade zones available. A model for developing countries. Only 3 tariff rates (0%, 5%, 12%) — most goods at 0%. De minimis GEL 300 (~$110) is generous. DCFTA with EU means zero duties on EU goods.",
