    de_minimis_usd: 165,
    clearance_process_en: 'Greek customs (AADE — Independent Authority for Public Revenue) follows EU Union Customs Code. ICISnet (Integrated Customs Information System) for electronic declarations. Piraeus port (largest in Mediterranean, operated by COSCO) and Athens Eleftherios Venizelos airport are major entry points. ELTA (Hellenic Post) handles postal customs. IOSS for low-value VAT.',
