    customs_reality_en: "Relatively efficient for the Caribbean. GCT at 16.5% plus CARICOM CET is the main tax burden. Additional Stamp Duty (ASD) at 0-20% effectively doubles duty on some items. SCF at 0.3% of CIF adds up. DHL, FedEx, UPS available in Kingston. Courier clearance 2-3 days. Postal mail via Jamaica Post 2-4 weeks. Kingston port is a major Caribbean transshipment hub. Environmental levy on certain goods. BSJ compliance can delay shipments.",
