    de_minimis_usd: 200,
    clearance_process_en: "Serviciul Vamal al Republicii Moldova (Customs Service of Moldova). ASYCUDA World system. EU DCFTA (Deep and Comprehensive Free Trade Area) since 2014 — duty-free access for many goods from EU. TVA (VAT) at 20% on imports. Moldovan leu (MDL) currency. EU accession candidate since 2022.",
