    clearance_process_en: "Direction Generale des Douanes manages customs. ASYCUDA system for declarations. Nouakchott port (Port de l'Amitie) and Nouadhibou are the main entry points. Arabic and French documentation accepted. Customs broker required for commercial imports. Not an ECOWAS CET member — applies own tariff schedule.",
