    customs_reality_en: "Walvis Bay is one of the best deep-water ports in southern Africa and serves as a transit hub for Botswana, Zambia, and Zimbabwe (TransCaprivi corridor). SACU membership means same tariffs as South Africa. NamRA customs is relatively efficient and professional. DHL, FedEx available in Windhoek and Walvis Bay. English-speaking which simplifies documentation. Postal service (NamPost) — 1-3 weeks. Good road infrastructure. Lower corruption than regional average. VAT at 15%.",
