    clearance_process_en: "Puerto Rico is a US TERRITORY — US customs rules fully apply. CBP (Customs and Border Protection) handles all clearance. ACE system. Section 321 de minimis at $800. NO customs duty on goods shipped from US mainland (domestic shipment). Foreign imports follow US tariff schedule (HTSUS). Local SUT (Sales and Use Tax) at 10.5% collected by retailers, not at customs.",
