    import_license_info_en: "Palestinian Authority issues import permits but Israel controls physical border crossings. Dual-use goods severely restricted by Israeli military. Many items banned for Gaza. West Bank has more flexibility than Gaza for imports.",
    import_license_info_ru: "ПА выдаёт импортные разрешения, но Израиль контролирует физические пограничные переходы. Товары двойного назначения жёстко ограничены. Многие товары запрещены для Газы. Западный берег имеет больше свободы.",
    customs_reality_en: "Extremely complex due to Israeli control of ALL borders. West Bank: goods transit through Israeli ports with significant delays and additional costs at checkpoints. Gaza: severe blockade restricts almost all imports — long waiting times, strict inspection, conflict periods halt all imports entirely. No direct international shipping to Palestinian territories. All express couriers route through Israel. Paris Protocol means Palestinian customs rates mirror Israeli ones, but PA has no control over border crossings. Clearance times completely unpredictable — can range from days to months.",
