    clearance_process_en: 'Qatar General Authority of Customs under GCC Common External Tariff. Standard 5% duty, 0% food staples, 100% tobacco, 100% alcohol. Al Nojoom electronic system for customs declarations. Hamad Port (modern facility, opened 2017) and Hamad International Airport are main entry points. Qatar Free Zones (QFZ) offer duty-free import regimes with 100% foreign ownership. NO VAT.',
