    de_minimis_usd: 0,
    clearance_process_en: "Zambia Revenue Authority (ZRA — zra.org.zm) manages customs. ASYCUDA World electronic system. COMESA and SADC member. VAT at 16% on imports. Landlocked — imports via Dar es Salaam (Tanzania), Durban (South Africa), Beira (Mozambique), or Walvis Bay (Namibia). Lusaka is the main clearance hub. Nakonde (Tanzania border) and Chirundu (Zimbabwe border — one-stop border post) are key crossing points.",
